          %p
          %h3#section_References References
          %p Some of these constructions are sketched in the drafts below.
          %p Topology and analysis:
          %ul
            %li#1
              [1] Misha Gavrilovich. The category of simplicial sets with a notion of smallness.
              %a{:href => "http://mishap.sdf.org/6a6ywke/6a6ywke.pdf"} (pdf)
          %p Geometric realisation:
          %ul
